-- A rule file that imports from two folders of its project by their aliases.
-- An alias is a short name for a folder, defined in l4-project.json, which
-- here is in the example folder. The same lines work from a file in any folder
-- of the project.
IMPORT `@common/definitions`
IMPORT `@vn10/nouns`

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an adult` age IF age AT LEAST `age of majority`

#EVAL `is an adult` 21
#EVAL `is an adult` 17
